t "Copied from the FCU mainboard (Power Connectors sheet), pin for pin. Only change: 5V_EXT comes from the
MIC29302 on the power sheet instead of J13. TPS2115A: IN1 = 5V_EXT wins above ~4 V (R201/R202 divider),
IN2 = USB VBUS otherwise; OUT = +5V. JP1: 1-2 normal (MCU rail VIN on +5V), 2-3 ISP (VIN on J201 VCC only)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "f340e231-2a9e-40f7-9f2e-fadb68d2d458")))
